          "title": "Shortcut Dasar",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Ctrl+Z** — Undo • **Ctrl+Shift+Z** — Redo\n• **Ctrl+C** — Copy • **Ctrl+V** — Paste\n• **Delete** — Hapus node/grup\n• **Space + Drag** — Pan canvas\n• **Scroll** — Zoom • **Shift + Klik** — Multi-select",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;\"><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+Z</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+C</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+V</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Delete</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Space+Drag</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Shift+Klik</kbd></div><div style=\"padding:0 16px 12px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:9px;color:#6366f1;\">Undo: Ctrl+Z</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:9px;color:#6366f1;\">Redo: Ctrl+Shift+Z</span></div></div>"
          }
